 "intent": "Specify the single-word bit operations of `indexed_bitvec_core`: the `word::Word` methods `from`/`into` (`u64` conversions), `len`, `get`, `set_copy`, `set`, `complement`, `count_ones`, `rank_ones`, `rank_zeros`, `select_ones`, `select_zeros`, the helper `word::select_ones_u16`, and the crate helpers `ceil_div` (usize) and `ceil_div_u64`. (`word.Word` is the `u64` newtype `struct Word(u64)`, represented by its payload.)",
